{"quest":{"line_id":"14010518","line_type":"5","order":539,"title":{"cn":"羊毛历险记","en":"The Quest for Wool","jp":"羊毛冒険記","kr":"양털 대작전"},"description":{"cn":"为了让一个小孩停止哭泣，你帮他拿到了他想要的羊毛，实现了他和小狗玩羊毛球的愿望。","en":"To comfort a crying little boy, you helped him collect some wool to make a wool ball for his puppy.","jp":"泣く子どもをなだめるため、羊毛を刈って渡した。彼はその羊毛でボールを作ると、犬と楽しそうに遊び始めた。","kr":"아이의 울음을 그치게 하기 위해서 양털을 구해 주었다. 그렇게 아이는 강아지와 양털 공놀이를 하고 싶다는 소원을 이루게 되었다."},"reputation_camp_id":"401","reputation_camp_title":{"cn":"深岩村","en":"Brimstone Village","jp":"オルディン村","kr":"깊은바위 마을"},"route":"#/season-4/daily/14010518","assets":[{"asset_key":"optional/objective_14010518:1:1"},{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14232540"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_14010518:1:2"},{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14232550"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_14010518:1:3"},{"asset_key":"faction_dailies/menu_14010518:1:3"},{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14232560"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_14010518:1:4"},{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14232570"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_14010518:1:5"},{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14232580"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_14010518:1:6"},{"asset_key":"faction_dailies/menu_14010518:1:6"},{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14232590"}],"tasks":[{"task_id":"1","steps":[{"step_id":"1","pre_step_ids":[],"objective_title":{"cn":"与祖娅对话","en":"Talk to Zanie","jp":"ゾーヤと話す","kr":"조아와 대화하기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"与祖娅对话，看看她有没有什么需要帮助的。","en":"Ask Zanie if she needs help.","jp":"ゾーヤと話して、何か力になれることがないか聞いてみよう。","kr":"조아와 대화해 도움이 필요한 일이 있는지 물어보자."}},{"step_id":"2","pre_step_ids":["1"],"objective_title":{"cn":"在村里转转","en":"Explore the Village","jp":"村を散策する","kr":"마을 둘러보기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"在村里转转，看看是否有孩子需要帮助。","en":"Explore the village and see if any children need help.","jp":"村を散策して、手助けが必要な子どもがいないか確かめよう。","kr":"마을을 둘러보며 도움이 필요한 아이가 있는지 살펴보자."}},{"step_id":"3","pre_step_ids":["2"],"objective_title":{"cn":"与小孩克里诺对话","en":"Talk to Kyran","jp":"子どものクリノと話す","kr":"크리노와 대화하기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"与小孩克里诺对话，询问他哭泣的原因。","en":"Ask Kyran why he is crying.","jp":"子どものクリノと話して、泣いている理由を尋ねよう。","kr":"크리노와 대화해 왜 울고 있는지 물어보자."}},{"step_id":"4","pre_step_ids":["3"],"objective_title":{"cn":"把绵羊带回来","en":"Bring the Sheep Back","jp":"羊を連れ戻す","kr":"양 되찾아오기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"克里诺想让你把绵羊带到他旁边来，完成他的心愿，他就不会哭了吧。","en":"Kyran wishes you could bring the sheep back. Cheer him up by fulfilling his request.","jp":"羊を連れ戻すようクリノに頼まれた。彼の願いを叶えて、泣き止ませよう。","kr":"크리노는 양을 데려와달라고 했다. 이 소원을 들어주면 울지 않겠지?"}},{"step_id":"5","pre_step_ids":["4"],"objective_title":{"cn":"剪一点羊毛","en":"Collect Wool","jp":"羊毛を刈る","kr":"양털 깎기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"克里诺有些害怕接近绵羊，请求你帮他剪一点羊毛。","en":"Kyran is too scared to get close to the sheep. He needs you to collect some wool for him.","jp":"クリノは羊に近づくのが怖いようだ。彼の代わりに羊毛を刈ってあげよう。","kr":"크리노는 양에게 다가가기 무섭다며 대신 양털을 깎아달라고 부탁했다."}},{"step_id":"6","pre_step_ids":["5"],"objective_title":{"cn":"把羊毛交给克里诺","en":"Give the Wool","jp":"羊毛をクリノに渡す","kr":"크리노에게 양털 주기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"把剪好的羊毛交给克里诺，看看他想做什么吧。","en":"Give the wool to Kyran and see what he does with it.","jp":"羊毛をクリノに渡して、彼が何をしたいのか見てみよう。","kr":"깎은 양털을 크리노에게 주고 무엇을 하려는지 지켜보자."}}]}],"archive_scope":"Configured faction daily paths. Live assignment, NPC visibility and minigame/battle success are not simulated.","source_plot_joins":[{"plot":"14232540","asset":"ep4/quest_story_14232540","resource":"nodecanvas/dialoguetree/ep4/quest_story_14232540.asset","raw_sha256":"6235b404299e48512a96b68c77bdaa7609c042e7a23dd1c7a11eaea0db702000","lpak":"binary_NodeCanvas_DialogueTree_17859706585472604641.lpak","offset":19536632,"size":1728,"identity":"14010518:1:1","field":"verified_npc_task_menu"},{"plot":"14232550","asset":"ep4/quest_story_14232550","resource":"nodecanvas/dialoguetree/ep4/quest_story_14232550.asset","raw_sha256":"db22443dae9355fb2011da8c7eb2f182f874cf9938f139ba9f8f17b3787b0d9a","lpak":"binary_NodeCanvas_DialogueTree_17859706585472604641.lpak","offset":19538360,"size":